WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.680 --> 00:00:02.980
So your dad [Jacob Rigmaiden] was one of the community leaders?

2
00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:04.020
Yes.

3
00:00:04.020 --> 00:00:06.140
Could you talk a little bit more about him?

4
00:00:06.140 --> 00:00:12.660
Well, Uncle Josh [Rigmaiden] was the leader . . . Josh Rigmaiden.

5
00:00:12.660 --> 00:00:17.860
Well, Uncle Josh was really . . . Well, he was the mayor of Mossville.

6
00:00:17.860 --> 00:00:20.800
That's what everybody . . . Yeah, everybody called him the mayor of Mossville.

7
00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:22.540
Was he voted, or . . . ?

8
00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:27.380
I don't think so, I think it's just something that the people just made him.

9
00:00:27.380 --> 00:00:27.580
Oh, okay.

10
00:00:27.380 --> 00:00:32.480
Because he would help them, and you know, anything that they needed.

11
00:00:32.480 --> 00:00:37.440
Like he was . . . Well, I guess Daddy, like,

12
00:00:37.440 --> 00:00:50.500
took his place when he died because he was like in with the politics as far as for the people to help the people in Mossville who was best . . . best served them and,

13
00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:57.540
you know, if they got in trouble or anything, he would go to talk to the sheriff,

14
00:00:57.540 --> 00:01:04.220
to the DA [district attorney]. and, you know, help them to get out of the trouble or whatever.

15
00:01:04.220 --> 00:01:09.240
And so, this is what Uncle Josh did.

16
00:01:09.240 --> 00:01:14.640
And then when Uncle Josh died, well, they said Daddy was the mayor.

17
00:01:14.640 --> 00:01:15.940
But Dad say he wasn't the mayor.

18
00:01:15.940 --> 00:01:19.300
They never . . . [laughing] There wasn't no election or nothing.

19
00:01:19.300 --> 00:01:26.780
It was just the people that, you know, just felt that way because they would help them.

20
00:01:26.780 --> 00:01:37.820
You know, whatever it was that they needed: financial, spiritual, whatever type of help, they would do that for them.

21
00:01:37.820 --> 00:01:46.304
So I guess that was just . . . I guess that was just in they blood to do that [Laughs].

22
00:01:46.304 --> 00:01:47.360
They were leaders?

23
00:01:47.360 --> 00:01:47.560
Yeah.
